
# AI Video Prompt Generator

An open-source tool that helps creators generate creative prompts for AI video generation.

## Features
- Cinematic video prompts
- Multiple video styles
- Camera movement options
- Vertical 9:16 video format
- Easy prompt generation
- Copy generated prompts

## Technology
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- GitHub Pages

## Live Website
https://alfiyanasreen26-droid.github.io/ai-video-prompt-generator/

## Project Vision
Our goal is to build an AI-powered video prompt generator that helps content creators, designers and marketers create professional video prompts easily.

## Current Status
Early-stage open-source project. Currently uses built-in prompt generation logic. AI API integration is planned for a future version.

